<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Karachi Blockade, 2020</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Karachi blockade&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Spring 2020&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-hyphenate: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;Following clashes with Chinese and Pakistani navies in the Indian Ocean, India have sent a task-force&amp;nbsp;in front&amp;nbsp;of major Pakistani port of Karachi to stop any reinforcement and supplies from East and muslim allies. India air campaign destroyed most of the SAM and enemy planes in south-eastern Pakistan but now the most advanced units of the Indian air force and navy are sent to the eastern front to face the Chinese threat. Pakistani navy and air force are tasked to remove the Indian blockade in front of their main port.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-hyphenate: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-hyphenate: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Playable from Pakistani side only&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-hyphenate: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Scenario created by Francesco Tomasinelli - &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;A href="mailto:giantsquid@tiscali.it"&gt;&lt;A href="mailto:ftomasinelli@gmail.com"&gt;&lt;EM&gt;ftomasin&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;EM&gt;elli@gmail.com&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-hyphenate: auto"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-ansi-language: EN-US"&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
